================================================================================
Value-Aware MARO Modifications (2026)
================================================================================

This repository further modifies and extends the hybrid-marl (Santos et al.) and 
EPyMARL codebases for the peer-reviewed publication:
"Value-Aware Prediction for Robust Multi-Agent Coordination Under Communication Loss"
(IEEE/RSJ IROS 2026).

Key additions and modifications by the authors include:
- Implementation of advantage-weighted predictive loss functions for observation imputation.
- Integration of an RL-synchronized training flow linking actor-critic advantages to the perception module.
- Custom experiment configuration files for Value-Aware MARO and baseline comparisons (e.g., va_maro.yaml).
- Updates to evaluation scripts, logging utilities, and MPE environment compatibility.

For a complete, line-by-line breakdown of modifications compared to the upstream 
repositories, please refer to the version control commit history of this project.